{"3035960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Augment Anthem", "steam_appid": 3035960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4556590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life on Earth is gone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two superintelligences destroyed the surface world. You are the Anthem's final creation -a synthetic warrior built to reclaim what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment Anthem is a <strong>2D sci-fi metroidvania</strong> focused on exploration, combat, and ability-driven progression. Combine four Augment types to reshape how you fight, move, and traverse a vast interconnected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected environments -from abandoned metro tunnels and war-torn ruins to flooded depths and corrupted machine nests. Every area hides upgrades, secrets, and lost data. Unlock new paths as your abilities grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport using your <strong>Tether</strong> to anchor points. Deploy a <strong>Teleport Beacon </strong>and instantly warp to it. Each ability opens routes that were previously unreachable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUGMENT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip powerful Augments -each containing an artificial entity with its own personality. Combine four types to modify your core abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend </strong>- Defy gravity. Reach platforms and areas that would otherwise be impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replicate </strong>- Split your capabilities across the battlefield. Deploy autonomous Beacon Robots, duplicate your drone, and evolve your weapon into a chaotic bullet-spawning system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet </strong>- Manipulate force. Unleash seeking and chain-reacting projectiles, and traverse magnetic surfaces with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amplify </strong>- Supercharge everything. Turn your basic gun into a devastating weapon and your drone into a relentless hunter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your <strong>gun, movement, tether, beacon and drone</strong>. Adapt your build to different combat and traversal challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/6b01a99362acdd1f02aad9769639687c.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/6b01a99362acdd1f02aad9769639687c.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/6b01a99362acdd1f02aad9769639687c.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight biomechanical enemies shaped by corrupted superintelligence. Each encounter tests your build and reflexes. Discover hidden upgrades and lost data throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD HAVEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to <strong>Haven</strong>, the last survivor settlement. Upgrade and expand the human town with collected machine parts. Unlock new dialogue, story paths, and shape the future of humanity through your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD RULED BY ARTIFICIAL GODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two superintelligences -<strong>ID</strong> and <strong>Superego </strong>-destroyed the surface world. Now their influence corrupts everything that remains. Uncover the truth behind the Anthem... and decide what humanity becomes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/697ad46a9c8abe4e67473b32a4e97911.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/697ad46a9c8abe4e67473b32a4e97911.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/697ad46a9c8abe4e67473b32a4e97911.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life on Earth is gone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two superintelligences destroyed the surface world. You are the Anthem's final creation -a synthetic warrior built to reclaim what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment Anthem is a <strong>2D sci-fi metroidvania</strong> focused on exploration, combat, and ability-driven progression. Combine four Augment types to reshape how you fight, move, and traverse a vast interconnected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/191091881cc79cd2e4dd83bab9d11e4b.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected environments -from abandoned metro tunnels and war-torn ruins to flooded depths and corrupted machine nests. Every area hides upgrades, secrets, and lost data. Unlock new paths as your abilities grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport using your <strong>Tether</strong> to anchor points. Deploy a <strong>Teleport Beacon </strong>and instantly warp to it. Each ability opens routes that were previously unreachable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/8212e5bea182e287c34935438bf85995.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUGMENT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >