agraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/7a8fd2f61008e6bcf219254f07f43248.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD HAVEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to <strong>Haven</strong>, the last survivor settlement. Upgrade and expand the human town with collected machine parts. Unlock new dialogue, story paths, and shape the future of humanity through your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.poster.avif?t=1778863432\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.webm?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/extras/68bace6dea5625161d9ba085ccae8590.mp4?t=1778863432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD RULED BY ARTIFICIAL GODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two superintelligences -<strong>ID</strong> and <strong>Superego </strong>-destroyed the surface world. Now their influence corrupts everything that remains. Uncover the truth behind the Anthem... and decide what humanity becomes next.</p><p class=\"